  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Courts Adm. pre-study Est</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DV f&#xf6;rstudie Estland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inom samarbetet med Baltikum inom r&#xe4;ttssektorn kommer en f&#xf6;rstudie ang r&#xe4;ttssamarbetet i Estland att g&#xf6;ras i samarbete m DV.Denna skall leda till att konkreta projektf&#xf6;rslag utarbetas p&#xe5; LFA-basis. St&#xf6;det inkluderar &#xe4;ven seminarieverksamhet ett avseende f&#xf6;rlikning i tviste m&#xe5;l och ett avseende domstolens m&#xf6;jligheter att minska h&#xe4;ktningstider</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of project proposals for the National Courts Administrati in Estonia, within the swedish cooperation in the legal sector with the Baltic States. This also includes two seminars one on friendly settlement of disputes in civil procedure and the second concerning the possibilities for courts to reduce detention period.</narrative>
  </description>
